WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.640
Ready for the playoffs

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.750
Who will be eligible for the playoffs?

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:10.960
For the playoffs, a player must have played at least half of the season’s games.

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:15.500
The app tracks each player’s attendance, game after game.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.940
And you know in time who to keep an eye on.

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:24.350
BaseballLineup. Less paperwork, more baseball.
